  "semantics_reviewed": [
    "Handle registration happens before make_thread returns and before thread start; retirement follows thread.finished, not worker.finished.",
    "Registry entries can represent jobs awaiting start or retirement; registered count is not a count of currently executing threads.",
    "The user_visible flag controls displays which honor it, preserves registration, and neither stops nor cancels work.",
    "RunRegistry.active returns registration order without filtering running state.",
    "is_spinning reports only the recurring animation timer; the separate appearance delay may remain active while the result is False; is_waiting checks that state.",
    "Shifted capture_figures keeps true for analysis and false only for read-only UI work that cannot emit figures, preserving the import boundary.",
    "Returned QThread/PipelineWorker pair is unstarted; Hindi countless and Icelandic unnecessary were identified and corrected, with other shifted targets preserved."
  ],
